        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't wait any longer, escape from school before night falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a point and touch horror decryption game with the theme of escape. Players will be transported into a fictional high school campus, unable to leave the teaching building restroom with rumors of strange stories on a dark day, and dragged into the strange stories in urgent need of decryption and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Drag and drop to view the details of the scene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to drag and drop the scene with the mouse to observe every corner of the scene, discover hidden elements, and find key puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Connecting two worlds through a camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a puzzle, one must open their discerning eye, as all the answers to the puzzle are hidden within the scene. Open your phone, connect the two worlds through its camera, find the corresponding clues, and unravel the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there is something that cannot be seen clearly, you can also try using the camera's zoom function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Your choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find the three precious treasures and escape from the chaos of destruction, whether you sink into the illusion or shatter the current situation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't wait any longer, escape from school before night falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a point and touch horror decryption game with the theme of escape. Players will be transported into a fictional high school campus, unable to leave the teaching building restroom with rumors of strange stories on a dark day, and dragged into the strange stories in urgent need of decryption and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Drag and drop to view the details of the scene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to drag and drop the scene with the mouse to observe every corner of the scene, discover hidden elements, and find key puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Connecting two worlds through a camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a puzzle, one must open their discerning eye, as all the answers to the puzzle are hidden within the scene. Open your phone, connect the two worlds through its camera, find the corresponding clues, and unravel the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there is something that cannot be seen clearly, you can also try using the camera's zoom function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Your choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find the three precious treasures and escape from the chaos of destruction, whether you sink into the illusion or shatter the current situation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Don't wait any longer, escape from school before night falls. This game is a point and touch horror decryption game with the theme of escape. Players will be transported into a fictional high school campus, unable to leave the teaching building restroom with rumors of strange stories on a dark day",
